 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "beat": "hook",
   "text": "Deep in your skin, right now, a new cell is being born.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "01.wav",
   "dur": 4.88,
   "sha256": "8074b65ac3e314cd1b96fbd19dbaad9ebd7a6f78ebe43abb562f0072bc025dba"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "normal",
   "text": "It starts at the very bottom… and slowly begins to rise.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 5.6,
   "sha256": "6d839d97e58c0c2f15ff7eacdf06588f198ddb676b5f1086f272c95855572148"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "change",
   "text": "As it climbs, it fills with a tough protein called keratin. It grows flatter… and flatter.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 8.16,
   "sha256": "f6cdf7bfebe698169ca66531b08fd2130b83ea54c1ef4b58140e93fc54da11fe"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "why",
   "text": "Near the top, it lets go of its nucleus… and its life gently ends.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 7.52,
   "sha256": "c6fbea0e0ca84e9826f578423a7e6901cf8b5aee5ddd51e2e8ffada8417dd3bf"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "why",
   "text": "So the skin you can touch right now is made of cells that have finished their lives.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 6.16,
   "sha256": "6d9d4fd1d6c5d162e926494b4baaf2ae5101cad6e876a68be34a74bf0c193f51"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "whoa",
   "text": "Stacked like bricks, they seal in water.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 4.32,
   "sha256": "14c050f21f628d8bf66003bc39c65fff9cc171d3e5c27f0c7a4164fb6dcd2431"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "whoa",
   "text": "The whole journey takes about a month.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
   "dur": 3.68,
   "sha256": "f0f7ad858071807b8ab102ac98f2bb1b39309148c854f4169f6797d1646583d6"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "beat": "takeaway",
   "text": "Then, quietly, the top cells drift away, far too small to see. Some of the dust in your home… began as you.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "08.wav",
   "dur": 10.24,
   "sha256": "4e33038af2022d0075aac3b87391b7d5800a43262e4683cd8133c4564596110a"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo09",
   "beat": "takeaway",
   "text": "Underneath, new cells are already rising. Always rebuilding… from the bottom up.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "09.wav",
   "dur": 8.08,
   "sha256": "ba21a5eca5e40c9b880427a903f6b23b70c3b2e4d68643ee7b5d1fdcd558c0b0"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo10",
   "beat": "cta",
   "text": "Your skin has plenty more quiet secrets. Tap like and follow.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "10.wav",
   "dur": 4.4,
   "sha256": "fc1f72633b869167f35eaeaf0052f270e6a1c7a1445b91c221f886e52a8da50c"
  }
 ]
}